### 1 Testar cpf com tamanho incorreto
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nome": "Teste tamanho cpf",
    "email": "erro@gmail.com",
    "senha": "123",
    "cpf": "12345",

    "celular": "48900000000"
}

